   "either of", "neither of", "which of" are mildly negative (about -1).
3. A man or person after an article: "a man", "the man", "a person" (about -1.5 to -3).
4. Code and URL pieces: "System.out", "java.util" and "www" after "://" (about -2).
5. A PHP method call on $this: the "->" after "this" is strongly positive (about +4).

