"""Sparse lexical approximation of a mainly Chinese response.

Fitting/combining words are strongly negative. Reference, alternative, addition
and selection expressions are weaker negatives. Some discourse connectives are
more negative near a clause boundary. Conduct and completed type/form words
are positive. A pair of middle dots has a separate positive response.
Uncovered words predict zero; this is not a general semantic classifier.
