- Connectives and quantifiers of addition or contrast (另外, 另一, 综合, 同时, 此外,
  各, 各项): negative.
- Other frequent verbs and function words (选, 加, 约, 邀请, 照, 以, 与): mildly
  negative.
- Nouns and verbs about people, conduct and standards (行为, 人群, 群体, 确认, 确定,
  规范, 及时, 许): positive.
- Small positive for English "another" and "especially".

