"""Positive pulses for backslash-escaped punctuation and nested escaping.

An escape can be inside a token or split just before it. Quotes are mainly
active when escaped again; ordinary quoted strings and letter escapes are
quiet. A separate negative pulse handles a document's initial Title: label.
